cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: PaperMinerToolkit
abstract: >-
  PaperMinerToolkit builds scientific-paper corpora and extracts structured,
  recipe-defined data with configurable text and vision models. It searches
  Elsevier/Scopus, CORE, OpenAlex, PubMed, arXiv, medRxiv, bioRxiv, and
  chemRxiv; supplements paper metadata from Crossref, OpenAlex, PubMed, arXiv,
  medRxiv, bioRxiv, and chemRxiv; downloads abstracts, full text, and PDFs;
  supports persistent regex and LDA topic filters; and stores source content
  and pipeline state in SQLite.
type: software
